## Why This Is Asked
Evaluates expertise in real-time blind source separation for production telemetry systems, combining theoretical signal processing with practical systems engineering under edge computing constraints.

## Key Concepts
- Online ICA and whitening for streaming data processing
- Adaptive forgetting mechanisms for nonstationary source tracking
- Temporal permutation resolution across sliding windows
- Edge infrastructure latency and computational optimization
- Validation methodology using synthetic ground-truth injection

## Code Example
```javascript
// Online Infomax-like ICA implementation
function onlineICA(whitenedData, learningRate) {
  // Initialize separation matrix
  let W = initializeMatrix();

  return function update(newSample) {
    // Natural gradient update
    const y = W * newSample;
    const g = tanh(y);
    const delta = learningRate * (g * newSample - (1 - g * g) * W);

    // Update separation matrix
    W += delta;
    return y;
  };
}
```

